WEBVTT

01:31.328 --> 01:34.920
[Episode 22]

01:34.920 --> 01:38.519
The scenery here is beautiful,
surrounded by clouds and mist.

01:38.519 --> 01:41.519
Looking up from the bottom of the valley,
it's like a fairyland.

01:41.519 --> 01:48.040
The scenery in this painting looks similar.

01:48.040 --> 01:50.599
Luo, do you know a flower--

01:50.599 --> 01:52.319
Luo.

01:52.319 --> 01:54.760
I see many flowers in this courtyard.

01:54.760 --> 01:56.040
May I ask what they are used for?

01:56.040 --> 01:58.280
Tomorrow is the Flower Festival here.

01:58.280 --> 02:00.920
I'm busy preparing flower cakes
for the festival.

02:00.920 --> 02:03.319
I'll leave you all to rest and talk.

02:03.319 --> 02:06.219
If you need anything, just let me know.

02:12.960 --> 02:16.639
Miss Meng,
I was about to ask about the Fuqing herb.

02:16.639 --> 02:19.479
- Why did you...
- We just got here.

02:19.479 --> 02:23.199
Bringing it up rashly might alert the enemy.

02:23.199 --> 02:24.479
Miss Meng.

02:24.479 --> 02:27.439
Luo is kind-hearted and simple.

02:27.439 --> 02:29.960
She saved me when I got bitten
by a venomous snake.

02:29.960 --> 02:31.240
She lived here with her brother.

02:31.240 --> 02:34.080
The local people almost live in isolation.

02:34.080 --> 02:35.919
They rarely interact with outsiders.

02:35.919 --> 02:37.319
Just in case.

02:37.319 --> 02:39.680
Let's check out the situation on our own.

02:39.680 --> 02:43.439
Yin Qing, you're familiar
with the mountain terrain.

02:43.439 --> 02:46.039
You'll arrange our operation.

02:46.039 --> 02:47.104
Yes.

02:47.104 --> 02:48.319
Your Majesty.

02:48.319 --> 02:50.400
The local terrain is complex.

02:50.400 --> 02:52.240
There are snakes, insects, and rats.

02:52.240 --> 02:53.439
For safety's sake,

02:53.439 --> 02:56.680
I suggest men and women pair up to search.

02:56.680 --> 02:57.919
I will go with Zhi Li.

02:57.919 --> 02:59.199
Relax.

02:59.199 --> 03:01.360
Is Zhi Li your sister or mine?

03:01.360 --> 03:04.719
Then I'll reluctantly go with Miss Yan.

03:04.719 --> 03:06.199
You've beaten me to it.

03:06.199 --> 03:09.439
Who exactly is reluctant? Make it clear.

03:09.439 --> 03:10.759
Just a slip of the tongue.

03:10.759 --> 03:15.000
I mean, it's my honor to protect Miss Yan.

03:15.000 --> 03:17.039
That's more like it.

03:17.039 --> 03:18.439
I'll go with Miss Meng--

03:18.439 --> 03:21.360
You're too weak to protect Miss Meng.

03:21.360 --> 03:22.840
I'll go with her tomorrow.

03:22.840 --> 03:25.900
No matter what you find,
you must return before dark.

03:26.730 --> 03:28.500
- What about me?
- Huang.

03:28.500 --> 03:30.620
You have much to do here.

03:32.240 --> 03:35.319
Huang, talk more with Luo

03:35.319 --> 03:36.840
to build some rapport.

03:36.840 --> 03:38.090
Don't talk nonsense.

03:38.090 --> 03:40.080
Huang, I mean,

03:40.080 --> 03:43.360
you should build a friendship with Luo

03:43.360 --> 03:46.439
to learn about the local customs here.

03:46.439 --> 03:47.939
What are you thinking?

03:51.680 --> 03:55.080
Huang, are you thinking of having a thing--

03:55.080 --> 03:56.580
No, I'm not.

03:59.080 --> 04:01.240
What a beautiful land!

04:01.240 --> 04:03.599
I've seen the gorgeous scenery here

04:03.599 --> 04:05.040
and the wildness in Shazhou.

04:05.040 --> 04:06.659
Amidst the beautiful land,

04:08.000 --> 04:10.900
there are many sceneries
I have never seen before.

04:14.560 --> 04:17.720
How time flies.
I've been away from Shazhou for a long time.

04:17.720 --> 04:20.399
Were you born in Shazhou,

04:20.399 --> 04:23.040
or brought to Shazhou by traffickers?

04:23.040 --> 04:24.560
I don't remember.

04:24.560 --> 04:28.339
As long as I can remember,
I have lived in Shazhou.

04:29.040 --> 04:32.420
What about your parents?
Do you still remember them?

04:33.079 --> 04:36.040
I can't remember anything before that.

04:36.040 --> 04:37.720
I feel like

04:37.720 --> 04:41.360
Your Majesty has been asking
about my past recently.

04:41.360 --> 04:43.300
It seems like you're investigating me.

04:45.720 --> 04:47.939
Can't I be curious about you?

04:53.360 --> 04:56.959
Your Majesty, aren't you clear about my past?

04:56.959 --> 04:58.699
I have seen the darkness,

04:59.616 --> 05:02.300
so I must break it down completely.

05:39.036 --> 05:41.899
You take a break here.
I'll go find something to eat.

06:03.360 --> 06:07.079
Look, I got you some fresh wild fruit.

06:07.079 --> 06:08.660
You can eat them.

06:13.759 --> 06:15.259
Is it good?

06:16.000 --> 06:17.500
So sweet.

06:23.079 --> 06:24.439
Want one?

06:24.439 --> 06:25.939
No, thanks.

06:26.680 --> 06:27.680
It's so cold.

06:27.680 --> 06:29.300
I'll add some more firewood.

06:50.639 --> 06:52.360
What's wrong with you?

06:52.360 --> 06:54.060
I feel hot.

06:54.800 --> 06:57.420
But it's cold. Don't catch a cold.

07:22.720 --> 07:25.240
Your Majesty,
it's my first time seeing you up close.

07:25.240 --> 07:29.939
You're not acting like yourself.

07:35.759 --> 07:37.259
What's wrong?

07:42.480 --> 07:43.980
What's going on?

07:58.279 --> 07:59.779
You try it.

08:18.560 --> 08:21.819
Do not eat it.
There's something wrong with this fruit.

08:33.320 --> 08:36.700
Do you still remember who you are?

08:41.559 --> 08:43.740
Look, do you know who I am?

08:49.559 --> 08:51.059
Meng Ting Hui.

08:52.799 --> 08:55.040
A subject who seduces the ruler

08:55.040 --> 08:57.360
will be sentenced to death.

08:57.360 --> 08:59.100
If you take one more step,

09:00.240 --> 09:03.000
we will both be doomed beyond redemption.

09:03.000 --> 09:04.899
A ruler who dotes on a subject

09:05.799 --> 09:08.100
deserves to write a self-reproach edict.

09:10.200 --> 09:12.460
Your Majesty, are you afraid?

09:14.360 --> 09:16.539
I have never been afraid.

09:17.240 --> 09:19.500
Me neither.

09:37.519 --> 09:39.019
Miss Meng.

10:03.159 --> 10:05.399
Miss Shen, you're back.

10:05.399 --> 10:06.899
Come and sit.

10:09.360 --> 10:10.860
Zhi Li.

10:13.776 --> 10:15.192
- Give it to me.
- Be careful. It's hot.

10:15.192 --> 10:16.236
Thanks.

10:16.236 --> 10:18.039
- Zhi Li.
- Thanks.

10:18.039 --> 10:20.399
Mr. Shen, you're back too. Come and sit.

10:20.399 --> 10:21.919
I can't believe you.

10:21.919 --> 10:25.039
You have such a bad sense of direction.

10:25.039 --> 10:26.960
We haven't found anything.

10:26.960 --> 10:29.139
My legs feel so tired.

10:30.080 --> 10:31.679
You've been complaining about being tired,

10:31.679 --> 10:33.000
so we kept resting, right?

10:33.000 --> 10:34.500
Otherwise, we would have long arrived.

10:35.688 --> 10:37.268
Master, you're back.

10:38.328 --> 10:39.872
Meng.

10:40.600 --> 10:42.100
You're back.

10:44.279 --> 10:47.539
What's wrong with you?
Why is your face so red?

10:55.656 --> 10:57.639
I picked plenty of fresh wild fruit

10:57.639 --> 10:59.139
to quench your thirst.

11:02.616 --> 11:04.488
- Here you go.
- Well...

11:04.488 --> 11:06.080
Fu Zhi.

11:06.864 --> 11:08.432
Don't eat that.

11:11.080 --> 11:12.740
Why not?

11:13.639 --> 11:16.440
This is the Hehuan fruit.

11:16.440 --> 11:20.299
Couples eat it to have a child.

11:24.960 --> 11:27.000
The wild fruits all look similar.

11:27.000 --> 11:29.860
Master, how did you know it?

11:34.519 --> 11:36.876
I have good news for you.

11:36.876 --> 11:39.820
I've found the Fuqing herb.

11:42.759 --> 11:44.159
Why are you only saying it now?

11:44.159 --> 11:46.799
Well...

11:46.799 --> 11:48.299
Alright, shut up.

11:51.480 --> 11:52.980
Luo.

11:53.840 --> 11:55.779
Do you know this Fuqing herb?

11:57.919 --> 11:59.120
Fuqing herb?

11:59.120 --> 12:01.476
In our valley, we call it Jinqian herb.

12:01.476 --> 12:04.580
Every household grows it deep in the valley.

12:09.948 --> 12:11.892
Luo.

12:11.892 --> 12:14.860
We need to tell you something.

12:17.424 --> 12:19.212
The herbalist is surnamed Lv.

12:19.212 --> 12:22.212
He said Jinqian herbs are rare and precious.

12:22.212 --> 12:24.519
That's why we started growing it
in large quantities.

12:24.519 --> 12:27.200
We just want to make a living here

12:27.200 --> 12:29.960
by exchanging herbs
for money to meet our daily needs.

12:29.960 --> 12:33.120
We didn't expect
that they would use Jinqian herbs

12:33.120 --> 12:35.748
to do so many evil things.

12:35.748 --> 12:37.559
Luo, don't be nervous.

12:37.559 --> 12:39.039
We tell you frankly

12:39.039 --> 12:42.240
because we believe you were used by bad guys.

12:42.240 --> 12:46.284
Seven days ago, my brother
was responsible for delivering the herbs.

12:46.284 --> 12:48.919
I originally thought he went hunting.

12:48.919 --> 12:50.419
But...

12:51.480 --> 12:52.799
Could he have...

12:52.799 --> 12:54.440
Luo, don't worry.

12:54.440 --> 12:57.759
We are here to find the one behind this

12:57.759 --> 12:59.559
and capture the entire criminal gang.

12:59.559 --> 13:01.812
Tomorrow, we will deliver the herbs

13:01.812 --> 13:04.059
to go into the belly of the beast.

13:05.120 --> 13:07.720
I'm willing to help deal with those bad guys.

13:07.720 --> 13:11.076
Originally, herbs were only delivered
at the beginning of each month.

13:11.076 --> 13:12.840
But we just received news

13:12.840 --> 13:15.612
that the herbalist
urgently wants our whole stock.

13:15.612 --> 13:18.259
It must be delivered early tomorrow morning.

13:21.660 --> 13:23.980
Luo, come and help prepare the flowers!

13:27.559 --> 13:28.759
Luo.

13:28.759 --> 13:32.500
This matter is of great importance.
Do not tell anyone else about it.

13:33.200 --> 13:34.519
I understand, Miss Meng.

13:34.519 --> 13:36.759
I know what to do.

13:36.759 --> 13:38.720
You guys talk here.

13:38.720 --> 13:42.059
I'll go deal with the things out there.

13:51.300 --> 13:53.320
Ling Yun Fei and his men

13:53.320 --> 13:55.779
are very likely hiding
in their pill-making place.

13:57.360 --> 13:59.679
Your Majesty, I have received news.

13:59.679 --> 14:01.120
Since the local terrain is complex,

14:01.120 --> 14:02.960
the main force of the Divine Guards
has been blocked on the way here.

14:02.960 --> 14:04.704
They will arrive at noon tomorrow.

14:04.704 --> 14:06.639
But the herbalist will trade
early tomorrow morning.

14:06.639 --> 14:09.360
If we wait for the army,
we will surely miss the opportunity.

14:09.360 --> 14:12.399
Luo's brother and other missing locals

14:12.399 --> 14:14.568
are very likely to become hostages.

14:14.568 --> 14:16.879
The longer they're gone,
the more danger they are in.

14:16.879 --> 14:19.919
The situation has changed.
Please make a decision, Your Majesty.

14:19.919 --> 14:22.200
Di Nian, you leave the valley tonight.

14:22.200 --> 14:25.279
At all costs,
lead the Divine Guards to rush here.

14:25.279 --> 14:26.352
Zhi Shu.

14:26.352 --> 14:28.840
You stay here with Zhi Li and Fu Zhi

14:28.840 --> 14:31.600
to protect the locals
and meet up with the Divine Guard.

14:31.600 --> 14:33.660
Yes, Your Majesty.

14:33.660 --> 14:34.680
What about Meng?

14:34.680 --> 14:36.960
The plan remains unchanged,
but the way to follow it needs to change.

14:36.960 --> 14:38.960
Tomorrow, we will disguise ourselves
as locals delivering herbs

14:38.960 --> 14:40.120
and infiltrate

14:40.120 --> 14:42.919
to buy time for Di Nian
and the Divine Guards.

14:42.919 --> 14:45.779
I'm going with Miss Meng.

14:46.500 --> 14:48.919
Tomorrow, we must capture Ling Yun Fei

14:48.919 --> 14:50.899
and destroy the Eternity Pills.

14:57.312 --> 15:03.159
[Blood Moon Society]

15:03.159 --> 15:06.759
Ying Gua and Meng Ting Hui
have located Wangxian Valley.

15:06.759 --> 15:09.159
Tomorrow,
they'll sneak in the Poisoned People's Mound.

15:09.159 --> 15:11.159
Mr. Shangguan actually let them investigate.

15:11.159 --> 15:13.000
Now a lot of Eternity Pills
have been produced.

15:13.000 --> 15:14.279
If the Poisoned People's Mound is destroyed--

15:14.279 --> 15:17.360
That's actually what Mr. Shangguan wants.

15:17.360 --> 15:20.519
Mr. Shangguan originally intended
to make money through the Eternity Pills.

15:20.519 --> 15:22.344
But Ling Yun Fei is a mad dog.

15:22.344 --> 15:24.840
He'll stop at nothing to kill Meng Ting Hui.

15:24.840 --> 15:26.600
He even dared to attack Mr. Shangguan.

15:26.600 --> 15:28.159
He has long been out of control.

15:28.159 --> 15:31.159
Mr. Shangguan has ordered the pill-makers
to transfer in batches.

15:31.159 --> 15:34.440
The Poisoned People's Mound
and Ling Yun Fei have been abandoned.

15:34.440 --> 15:37.559
It's kind of a gift to Meng Ting Hui.

15:37.559 --> 15:41.120
It's to invite the enemy into the trap.

15:41.120 --> 15:43.759
Mr. Shangguan wants to set them up.

15:43.759 --> 15:45.559
He will make Ying Gua
and Ling Yun Fei kill each other.

15:45.559 --> 15:48.279
Whether Ling Yun Fei lives or dies
doesn't matter.

15:48.279 --> 15:52.519
But Ying Gua must die
in the Poisoned People's Mound.

15:52.519 --> 15:55.679
Then the world will only think
that Ling Yun Fei killed the emperor.

15:55.679 --> 15:56.919
Without a ruler,

15:56.919 --> 16:00.379
this beautiful land
will eventually belong to Zhongwan.

16:01.000 --> 16:09.240
Kill Ying Gua!

16:19.480 --> 16:21.360
Go on.

16:21.360 --> 16:22.559
Feed them all pills.

16:22.559 --> 16:24.059
Yes.

16:24.919 --> 16:27.320
Master, a letter from Lord Gu.

16:27.320 --> 16:30.799
- Read it.
- Meng Ting Hui has left the capital.

16:30.799 --> 16:33.519
Stop making Eternity Pills. Don't...

16:33.519 --> 16:35.399
Go on!

16:35.399 --> 16:37.508
Don't go crazy and implicate me.

16:38.360 --> 16:39.879
Who is he to tell me what to do?

16:39.879 --> 16:41.279
I won't listen to him!

16:41.279 --> 16:43.039
Tell those pill-makers

16:43.039 --> 16:45.720
to make Eternity Pills faster.

16:45.720 --> 16:49.559
This time, I'll make Meng Ting Hui
taste the Eternity Pill

16:49.559 --> 16:52.399
and disturb the peace of the capital.

16:52.399 --> 16:53.720
Master.

16:53.720 --> 16:55.240
Our gang has been raided.

16:55.240 --> 16:56.519
And we retreated here.

16:56.519 --> 16:58.399
We've lost more than half of our men.

16:58.399 --> 17:00.799
It's not advisable
to fight head-on right now.

17:00.799 --> 17:03.259
- Where there is life, there is hope.
- What about Ru Yan's death?

17:03.960 --> 17:06.000
What about Lv Er's death?

17:06.000 --> 17:09.200
If you're afraid of death, get lost now.

17:09.200 --> 17:10.480
Master, don't get me wrong.

17:10.480 --> 17:12.440
I've been working with you
for over ten years.

17:12.440 --> 17:14.660
When have I ever said I was afraid?

17:15.920 --> 17:20.079
I will never betray you, Master.

17:20.079 --> 17:24.880
All these years,
you have risked your life for me.

17:24.880 --> 17:27.720
You treat me better than my own brother.

17:27.720 --> 17:31.279
But Meng Ting Hui killed our beloved ones.

17:31.279 --> 17:32.720
If we don't avenge their deaths,

17:32.720 --> 17:35.519
what's the point of living in this world?

17:35.519 --> 17:37.519
Master.

17:37.519 --> 17:42.640
I know how you suffer after Ru Yan died.

17:42.640 --> 17:45.839
I also want to avenge my brother's death.

17:45.839 --> 17:48.099
Since you have decided,

17:48.799 --> 17:50.619
I'll be with you, alive or dead.

17:57.640 --> 17:59.400
Good brother.

17:59.400 --> 18:01.039
But Master,

18:01.039 --> 18:05.480
Lord Gu said that Meng Ting Hui
and others are not in the capital.

18:05.480 --> 18:08.500
Could they have found Wangxian Valley?

18:10.319 --> 18:13.400
These Eternity Pills are almost complete.

18:13.400 --> 18:16.160
Those locals are a burden.

18:16.160 --> 18:18.779
When the last batch of herbs is delivered,

18:19.720 --> 18:23.779
you take our men
to slaughter the valley once and for all.

18:26.079 --> 18:27.264
Every year at the Flower Festival,

18:27.264 --> 18:29.759
we exchange flowers to convey our feelings.

18:29.759 --> 18:33.140
This bouquet is for you.
May you be safe and well.

18:34.000 --> 18:35.119
Thank you, Luo.

18:35.119 --> 18:38.160
Then we wish you and other locals

18:38.160 --> 18:40.164
peace and safety year after year.

18:40.164 --> 18:41.672
Thanks.

18:43.236 --> 18:45.920
Huang, why are you smiling?

18:45.920 --> 18:47.532
Huang.

18:47.532 --> 18:50.028
Thankfully, Luo took care of you
when you were injured.

18:50.028 --> 18:52.039
Shouldn't you give a bouquet
to express your gratitude?

18:52.039 --> 18:55.272
Yes, Huang Bo, we're leaving tomorrow.

18:55.272 --> 18:56.804
Come on.

18:58.319 --> 18:59.819
Luo.

19:01.279 --> 19:03.519
I owe you big time.

19:03.519 --> 19:04.599
Huang.

19:04.599 --> 19:07.500
Are you going
to become sworn siblings with Luo?

19:08.279 --> 19:11.720
Nian, look, I owe you big time.

19:11.720 --> 19:13.220
Thanks.

19:15.079 --> 19:16.200
Miss.

19:16.200 --> 19:18.119
Will you swing with us?

19:18.119 --> 19:20.160
Take it. Let's go.

19:20.160 --> 19:22.680
Xiao Yue,
I'll use this peach wood as a witness.

19:22.680 --> 19:25.759
I wish to enjoy the flowers with you

19:25.759 --> 19:28.319
and live an ordinary life together.

19:28.319 --> 19:31.680
I hope we're together forever.

19:31.680 --> 19:33.180
Me too.

19:34.519 --> 19:36.839
Why did he give the peach wood?

19:36.839 --> 19:38.400
This is a tradition here.

19:38.400 --> 19:40.700
Peach wood is used to express love.

19:42.319 --> 19:43.848
Zhi Li.

19:43.848 --> 19:45.839
The locals say that during the festival,
they give flowers as blessings.

19:45.839 --> 19:47.839
I'm about to leave the valley.

19:47.839 --> 19:50.380
So I'm giving you this.

19:56.799 --> 19:59.400
Nian, with these flowers,

19:59.400 --> 20:01.920
I wish you would find a girl you like.

20:01.920 --> 20:04.819
Then I won't have to worry about you anymore.

20:28.920 --> 20:30.559
This is a local specialty.

20:30.559 --> 20:32.220
It's not available in the capital.

20:56.519 --> 20:59.099
Luo, what's wrong?

21:00.279 --> 21:02.496
Every year at the Flower Festival,

21:02.496 --> 21:05.339
my brother always
makes my favorite flower cakes.

21:06.480 --> 21:08.339
If only my brother were here.

21:10.000 --> 21:12.460
That is beautiful.

21:16.559 --> 21:18.059
Do you want to learn?

21:22.559 --> 21:23.720
Luo.

21:23.720 --> 21:25.220
Look.

21:27.960 --> 21:30.519
Is it not pretty?

21:30.519 --> 21:32.200
I think it's very pretty.

21:32.200 --> 21:35.619
This is the most special flower wreath
I've ever seen.

21:47.240 --> 21:48.740
Looks good?

21:50.039 --> 21:51.539
Sure.

22:00.519 --> 22:03.460
The festival is almost over,
but you haven't given out your bouquet yet.

22:06.759 --> 22:07.884
It's hard to find the right one.

22:07.884 --> 22:09.559
I need to choose a suitable place

22:09.559 --> 22:11.160
to prove my sincerity.

22:11.160 --> 22:14.616
So, you have your eye on my swing?

22:14.616 --> 22:16.160
I'll let you have it.

22:18.039 --> 22:19.236
I've looked around,

22:19.236 --> 22:21.480
but none of the girls here
are as pretty as you.

22:21.480 --> 22:22.920
Shen Zhi Shu.

22:22.920 --> 22:26.779
How many girls have you sweet-talked?

22:30.468 --> 22:32.160
Yes.

22:32.160 --> 22:34.279
I used to be a playboy.

22:34.279 --> 22:36.099
I thought I was happy.

22:36.920 --> 22:38.579
But since I met you,

22:44.039 --> 22:45.859
I've realized what fear is.

22:46.932 --> 22:48.440
What do you fear?

22:50.359 --> 22:52.200
I fear you frown.

22:52.200 --> 22:53.700
I fear you turn away.

22:55.240 --> 22:56.740
I'm more afraid...

22:59.039 --> 23:00.779
I'm more afraid you won't believe

23:01.896 --> 23:04.140
that I have eyes only for you.

23:10.640 --> 23:15.240
Perhaps at this moment, you like me.

23:15.240 --> 23:18.599
But how long will you like me?

23:18.599 --> 23:22.700
So many noble ladies in the capital like you.

23:23.319 --> 23:26.759
Are you really willing to give them all up?

23:26.759 --> 23:27.920
I promise you.

23:27.920 --> 23:30.700
If I flirt with any woman,
you can just leave me.

23:32.279 --> 23:36.380
Can you give me a chance to prove my love?

23:57.440 --> 23:59.180
How much do they cost?

23:59.960 --> 24:01.668
You don't have to buy them.

24:01.668 --> 24:04.440
What I fear most is that you don't know
they cost me several years of salary.

24:04.440 --> 24:06.460
If you don't, how can I prove my sincerity?

24:15.640 --> 24:17.140
I know.

24:18.480 --> 24:20.460
You're afraid that you'll hinder my career.

24:22.279 --> 24:24.420
But how could I not know
how you feel about me?

24:26.519 --> 24:30.339
And how could you not know
how I feel about you?

24:49.960 --> 24:51.460
They fit quite well.

24:53.960 --> 24:56.460
I knew the right size the first time we met.

24:57.839 --> 24:59.339
Don't be silly.

25:04.400 --> 25:05.900
Does it still hurt?

25:08.960 --> 25:10.460
Sure.

25:16.160 --> 25:18.140
This way, I'll keep it in mind forever.

26:24.160 --> 26:26.079
The Flower Festival is vibrant out there.

26:26.079 --> 26:27.920
Why don't you go join them?

26:27.920 --> 26:31.799
I feel mixed emotions
when I see those local people.

26:31.799 --> 26:33.579
They are so simple and honest.

26:34.480 --> 26:37.599
They originally wanted
to use the Fuqing herbs to earn money.

26:37.599 --> 26:39.500
But they were used by the Huxiao Gang,

26:40.176 --> 26:42.880
helping them make the Eternity Pills.

26:42.880 --> 26:45.440
It's not the sword that kills,

26:45.440 --> 26:47.220
but the person who wields it.

26:48.240 --> 26:50.480
The Fuqing herb is actually not scary.

26:50.480 --> 26:52.660
What's scary are people
with ulterior motives.

27:50.279 --> 27:52.960
Go forward along this path for ten li.

27:52.960 --> 27:55.599
That's where we trade herbs
with the herbalist.

27:55.599 --> 27:58.799
The mountain road is rugged.
We need to travel through the night.

27:58.799 --> 28:02.200
Please help me find my brother.

28:02.200 --> 28:04.079
Luo, don't worry.

28:04.079 --> 28:07.359
We will definitely find a way
to find your brother.

28:07.359 --> 28:08.859
Don't worry.

28:10.839 --> 28:14.259
Your leg injury hasn't healed yet.
You must be careful.

28:16.400 --> 28:17.799
This is the sachet I embroidered.

28:17.799 --> 28:19.279
My brother has one too.

28:19.279 --> 28:23.019
I hope both of you can stay safe.

28:28.000 --> 28:29.759
Luo.

28:29.759 --> 28:33.160
I don't have anything to give you.

28:33.160 --> 28:36.819
When I come back,
I'll make a beautiful wreath for you.

28:38.200 --> 28:39.700
I'll wait for you.

28:41.240 --> 28:44.059
It's getting late. We should set off.

29:09.400 --> 29:10.452
Hey, sirs.

29:10.452 --> 29:13.119
Here are the four boxes of Fuqing herbs.
Please take a look.

29:13.119 --> 29:14.440
I've been watching you two for a while.

29:14.440 --> 29:16.092
Haven't seen you before.

29:16.092 --> 29:19.319
Well, here is the thing.

29:19.319 --> 29:20.319
Do you want to die?

29:20.319 --> 29:21.799
Sir, please calm down.

29:21.799 --> 29:25.019
It's his first time delivering herbs,
and he doesn't know the rules.

29:30.960 --> 29:34.660
The herbs are all here. Well...

29:36.636 --> 29:39.559
- Get lost!
- Sure.

29:39.559 --> 29:41.059
May you make a fortune.

29:49.359 --> 29:52.259
Quick, send these herbs to the warehouse.

30:43.480 --> 30:45.359
Nothing found.

30:45.359 --> 30:47.299
Have they already been sent to the capital?

30:48.000 --> 30:50.099
It seems they have already noticed.

30:54.720 --> 30:56.220
Miss Meng.

30:57.000 --> 30:58.980
Are you looking for the Eternity Pills?

31:00.319 --> 31:01.980
I've brought them for you.

31:04.519 --> 31:07.000
Today we will destroy your den

31:07.000 --> 31:08.559
and take you back to the capital for trial.

31:08.559 --> 31:12.759
You're in my territory.
How dare you talk big!

31:12.759 --> 31:15.640
I've ordered the Divine Guards
to surround this place.

31:15.640 --> 31:18.759
I won't let you use the Eternity Pills
to wreak havoc in the capital.

31:18.759 --> 31:21.079
Here comes the emperor.

31:21.079 --> 31:24.420
But here's the thing, my place is lawless.

31:40.119 --> 31:41.440
See?

31:41.440 --> 31:43.880
They have been fed plenty of Eternity Pills.

31:43.880 --> 31:45.920
They have long turned
from pill users into poison carriers.

31:45.920 --> 31:49.200
If they appear on the streets of the capital,

31:49.200 --> 31:51.279
what will happen?

31:51.279 --> 31:54.359
The entire capital will become my purgatory.

31:54.359 --> 31:56.980
All the people will die with you.

33:40.559 --> 33:41.960
<i>This is the sachet I embroidered.</i>

33:41.960 --> 33:43.559
My brother has one too.

33:43.559 --> 33:45.059
That's Luo's brother.

34:01.000 --> 34:02.740
It's been so long.

34:04.080 --> 34:06.539
I wonder if things are going well for Meng.

34:08.760 --> 34:10.559
I heard that honey water
helps relieve fatigue and sleep.

34:10.559 --> 34:13.039
I specially made it with warm water,
not too hot or too cold.

34:13.039 --> 34:14.539
Try it.

34:16.280 --> 34:17.940
Shen Zhi Shu, you're cheating!

34:39.960 --> 34:41.460
Now that's cheating.

34:42.519 --> 34:44.019
Zhi Shu.

34:45.320 --> 34:46.820
You two...

34:47.440 --> 34:49.000
It's just as you see.

34:49.000 --> 34:50.539
We are together.

34:56.440 --> 34:59.840
I expected you two would end up together.

34:59.840 --> 35:02.159
But you are now inseparable

35:02.159 --> 35:03.719
and lovey-dovey.

35:03.719 --> 35:05.840
It really surprises me.

35:05.840 --> 35:08.139
If you're envious, go find one yourself.

35:10.079 --> 35:11.079
Is it sweet?

35:11.079 --> 35:12.679
Yes.

35:12.679 --> 35:15.199
Mr. Shen, Miss Shen.

35:15.199 --> 35:16.239
Luo.

35:16.239 --> 35:19.519
It's bad.
I just saw some strangers outside the valley.

35:19.519 --> 35:22.500
They look like those Fuqing herb buyers.

35:23.172 --> 35:24.920
Luo, you don't know martial arts.

35:24.920 --> 35:27.039
Is there a safe hiding place in the valley?

35:27.039 --> 35:30.239
Yes, deep in the valley,
there is an abandoned watchtower.

35:30.239 --> 35:32.880
That's where the local people usually rest.

35:32.880 --> 35:35.000
That's a good hiding place.
You go hide there quickly.

35:35.000 --> 35:36.280
I will notify the locals
to go there immediately.

35:36.280 --> 35:37.840
I'll go with you.

35:37.840 --> 35:40.320
Don't worry. I'll meet up with you soon.

35:40.320 --> 35:42.400
Zhi Shu, be careful.

35:42.400 --> 35:43.900
Remember to drink it.

36:01.400 --> 36:02.900
Come on!

36:03.840 --> 36:05.159
Move!

36:05.159 --> 36:06.159
- Come on!
- Move fast!

36:06.159 --> 36:07.719
Kneel!

36:07.719 --> 36:09.760
Don't hit my sister.

36:09.760 --> 36:13.099
Master Ling has ordered not to harm children.

36:13.719 --> 36:16.800
Please, sir, spare our lives.

36:16.800 --> 36:19.340
We are just farmers.

36:23.920 --> 36:25.280
Farmers?

36:25.280 --> 36:26.360
Yes.

36:26.360 --> 36:27.960
That's perfect.

36:27.960 --> 36:30.260
Use your blood to fertilize the land.

36:34.360 --> 36:35.860
Niu!

36:39.239 --> 36:41.260
Niu!

36:44.960 --> 36:46.460
Stop!

36:50.280 --> 36:51.980
Mr. Shen.

36:52.679 --> 36:54.400
You are quite smart.

36:54.400 --> 36:57.000
You actually found us.

36:57.000 --> 36:59.400
You don't even spare the weaklings.

36:59.400 --> 37:01.760
You are worse than beasts.

37:01.760 --> 37:04.119
They are all worthless people.

37:04.119 --> 37:05.960
What's the big deal?

37:05.960 --> 37:08.400
Everyone here must die,

37:08.400 --> 37:09.900
including you.

37:10.599 --> 37:12.099
Kill them all!

37:56.840 --> 37:57.840
Chase them!

37:57.840 --> 37:59.340
Chase!

38:03.880 --> 38:05.639
Everyone, get up.

38:05.639 --> 38:07.219
You are safe now.

38:11.360 --> 38:14.639
Thank you, Mr. Shen.

38:14.639 --> 38:16.239
Thank you, Mr. Shen.

38:16.239 --> 38:19.260
Go back quickly. Go back.

38:53.400 --> 38:54.900
Your Majesty.

38:56.360 --> 38:59.199
We were blocked by their guards for a while,
so we're late.

38:59.199 --> 39:01.880
It's fine.
They've moved out the Eternity Pills.

39:01.880 --> 39:04.480
Yin Qing, go search and see
if there are any Eternity Pills left here.

39:04.480 --> 39:05.960
Destroy them all.

39:05.960 --> 39:08.519
Huang Bo,
come with me to contain Ling Yun Fei.

39:08.519 --> 39:10.019
Yes.

39:25.440 --> 39:27.239
I can't believe you're still alive.

39:27.239 --> 39:29.000
Ling Yun Fei.

39:29.000 --> 39:30.519
You have harmed my people

39:30.519 --> 39:31.880
and wreaked havoc on the country.

39:31.880 --> 39:34.679
That's a heinous crime.

39:34.679 --> 39:36.960
Today, you'll die!

39:36.960 --> 39:38.460
Kill them!

40:20.559 --> 40:22.059
Your Majesty, be careful!
